---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Read, edit, initialize and validate `instrukt.yaml`

Usage: instrukt config <COMMAND>

Commands:
  get       Print the value at a dotted path, or the whole configuration, interpolated. Reads the
            effective configuration (the global layer with the project layer applied) unless
            --global
  show      Inspect machine-local configuration
  patch     Apply a merge patch (YAML mapping) to the project layer, or the global layer with
            --global, if it is still at --revision
  init      Create the layer with the current schema version and defaults, or migrate an existing
            older one
  validate  Report the layer's findings; exits non-zero when there are any
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
